; Exercise 3: a noun phrase is an adjective list and a noun, and an
; adjective list is one adjective, or an adjective followed by a list,
; with the short alternative first, as Metcalfe warns against.
;
;   <phrase> ::= <list> <noun>
;   <list>   ::= <adj> | <adj> <list>
;   <adj>    ::= BIG | BAD          <noun> ::= BEAR

        CALL    PHRASE
        STOP
PHRASE  CALL    LIST
        FALSE   P9
        CALL    NOUN
P9      RETURN
LIST    CALL    ADJ
        TRUE    L9
        CALL    MORE
L9      RETURN
MORE    CALL    ADJ
        FALSE   M9
        CALL    LIST
M9      RETURN
ADJ     MATCH   BIG
        TRUE    A9
        MATCH   BAD
A9      RETURN
NOUN    MATCH   BEAR
        RETURN
